<title>ARGENTINA: Radio telescope observatory in Argentina.</title>
<headline>Radio telescope observatory in Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four European space agencies have decided to install a radio telescope observatory in the mountains near Salta in northern Argentina, state news agency Telam reported on Sunday.</p>
<p>The four include the Dutch Foundation for Astronomy Investigation and a French agency.</p>
<p>Conditions in the northern regions of Chile and Argentina are considered well suited for observing space because of the dry climate and high altitude.</p>
</text>
